RE-LICENSE NOTE (history)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package was previously distributed internally as
`@ariada-org/test-fixtures` v0.1.0 under Apache-2.0 (private monorepo only).
On 2026-05-16 it was re-licensed to EUPL-1.2 in preparation for public
npm publication. On 2026-05-24 the fixture content was re-dedicated to
the public domain under CC0-1.0 to align with Horizon Europe Article 17
open-data principles and to reduce attribution friction for downstream
toolchains; `src/serve.ts` was kept on EUPL-1.2. The original package
was never published to npm under Apache-2.0, so no third-party copyright
is affected by the historic Apache→EUPL→CC0 transition for fixture content.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CONTENT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`fixtures/` contains:
  - Generic axe-core HTML cases (alt-text, color-contrast, iframe, shadow-DOM)
  - `eu-real-world/` — EU-pattern fixtures (Klarna-style SE checkout, BankID-
    style SE authentication, MobilePay-style DK merchant flow, Finnish DOS-lagen
    statement, German Mittelstand, French RGAA)

All `eu-real-world/` fixtures carry an in-file `License: CC0-1.0` header
and a `Status: PASS|FAIL|MIXED` marker.

